# Vercel Blob read/write token. Required only in production (or if you want
# this local dev server to talk to real Blob storage instead of the local
# file-backed stub at .data/ledger.json).
#
# Create a Blob store from the Vercel dashboard (Storage tab) or the
# Marketplace, then copy its token here — or run `vercel env pull` to fetch
# it automatically once the project is linked.
BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=
